<h2>Thirty frames on every console</h2>
<p>Rockstar confirmed before launch that the game runs at 30 frames per second everywhere, with no 60 frame mode. The reason is the processor. A city full of people who think, move and react is heavy work for the CPU, and the PS5 Pro's extra graphics power does not change that. So do not buy a Pro expecting smoother motion. Buy it for a sharper picture, better shadows and fewer dips.</p>
<p>On a television, 30 steady frames from three metres away look better than they sound. Film mode off, game mode on, and motion blur left at the game's default is a good start.</p>

<h2>PlayStation 5: which one?</h2>
