<p>Both consoles run the full game, released on the same day as the PlayStation version. They are less common in Nepal. On 25 November 2026 the last listed prices we found were <strong>Rs 1,47,000 for the <a href="/products/microsoft-xbox-series-x">Series X</a></strong> with a disc drive and <strong>Rs 69,401 for the 512GB <a href="/products/microsoft-xbox-series-s">Series S</a></strong>, and both were out of stock.</p>
