<h2>Buying a used console</h2>
<p>Used PS5s from 2020 to 2022 are sold at Rs 55,000 to 75,000, and run GTA VI exactly like a new one. Sign in to the network to make sure it is not banned. Play something demanding for half an hour and listen to the fan. Test every port and both sticks. Ask the owner to deactivate and reset it in front of you. Check that the system software updates.</p>

<h2>Setting up your account</h2>
<ol>
<li>Choose a store region once and stay with it. Nepal has no PlayStation store of its own, and purchases cannot be moved.</li>
<li>Use your own dollar card or a gift card of the same region.</li>
<li>Turn on two-step verification.</li>
<li>Set parental controls by age if children use the console. The game is rated 17+ and PEGI 18.</li>
