<p>In November 1997 a small studio in Dundee, Scotland released a game in which you looked down on cartoon streets and stole cars. Twenty-nine years later, the latest in the series earned more on its first day than any film has in its whole run at the cinema. This is how it happened, game by game, with what each one added and why people in Nepal, most of whom met the series in a cyber cafe, still remember it.</p>

<h2>The whole series at a glance</h2>
<table><thead><tr><th>Year</th><th>Game</th><th>Where</th><th>First on</th></tr></thead><tbody>
